  inci = $gt$Aqua, Argireline, Betain, Aquaxyl, Sodium Hyaluronate 10-100 kDa, Grapeseed Oil, Macadamia Nut Oil, Jojoba Oil, Shea Butter, OleoSoft-4, Olivem 1000, Cetyl Palmitate, Lannet O, Caprylic Triglyceride, Hydrolyzed Wheat Protein, D-panthenol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Glycerine, Euxyl PE 9010.$gt$,
